{"unit_id":"YZz-S__dsh-token-cost-meter#feature-1","repo":"YZz-S/dsh-token-cost-meter","commit":"c36087118c8df000ec721ea4f2553aca480b50e2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-token-cost-meter 的功能「会话 token 与费用读数」：读取会话投影中的输入缓存命中、未命中、缓存写入和输出 token，并在 composer dock 显示累计 token 与估算人民币费用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:66-71"]}
